#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/cross_reference_master.rst:5
msgid "Cross reference at master element"
msgstr "主元件的交叉引用"

#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/cross_reference_master.rst:7
msgid ""
"A master element can have many slave element linked. QElectroTech allows "
"that one master element has more than one cross reference defined. This "
"characteristic is similar to the physical devices, the component which "
"manage the control signal can define the action from many different "
"components of the device."
msgstr ""
"一个主元件可以有许多奴隶元素链接。QElectroTech允许一个主元件有多个交叉引用定义，这个特性与物理设备类似，管理控制信号的组件可以定义来自设备许多不同组件的动作。"

#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/cross_reference_master.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech master element cross reference"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech主元件交叉参考"

#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/cross_reference_master.rst:17
msgid ""
"The master element is the element which should appear at the Bill of "
"Materials (BOM), it s the element with all the information. All slave "
"element linked are following the master element."
msgstr "主元件是材料法案(BOM)中应该出现的元素，它是所有信息的元素。所有链接的奴隶元素都遵循主元件。"
